#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"executor\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"executor\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Executor primitive {#executor-primitive}"
msgstr "Primitiv Executor {#executor-primitive}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Executor is a new Qiskit Runtime primitive that takes the (template circuit, samplex) pair as input, generates and binds parameter values according to the samplex, executes the bound circuits on the hardware, and returns the execution results and metadata. It follows the directives of the input pair and does not make any implicit decisions for you, so that the process is transparent yet performant. \n"
msgid "Executor is a new IBM Quantum primitive that takes the (template circuit, samplex) pair as input, generates and binds parameter values according to the samplex, executes the bound circuits on the hardware, and returns the execution results and metadata. It follows the directives of the input pair and does not make any implicit decisions for you, so that the process is transparent yet performant. \n"
msgstr "Executor je nový primitiv Qiskit Runtime, který přijímá dvojici (šablona Circuit, samplex) jako vstup, generuje a váže hodnoty parametrů podle samplexu, spouští vázané Circuit na hardwaru a vrací výsledky spouštění a metadata. Řídí se direktivami vstupní dvojice a neprovádí za tebe žádná implicitní rozhodnutí, takže proces je transparentní, ale výkonný.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "NoiseLearnerV3 {#noiselearnerv3}"
msgstr "NoiseLearnerV3 {#noiselearnerv3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Similar to the current [`NoiseLearner`](/guides/noise-learning), this Qiskit Runtime helper program returns the sparse [Pauli-Lindblad noise model](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866) that is used in many error mitigation methods, including [PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec), [PEA](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea), and [PNA](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna/tree/main). In the original `NoiseLearner`, you pass in a list of circuits, and the program stratifies the circuits into layers and returns the noise model for each unique layer. `NoiseLearnerV3`, on the other hand, gives you control over how to stratify your circuits, and the program simply takes a list of boxed circuit instructions (for example, unique layers) as the inputs. \n"
msgid "Similar to the current [`NoiseLearner`](/guides/noise-learning), this `qiskit-ibm-runtime` helper program returns the sparse [Pauli-Lindblad noise model](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866) that is used in many error mitigation methods, including [PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec), [PEA](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea), and [PNA](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna/tree/main). In the original `NoiseLearner`, you pass in a list of circuits, and the program stratifies the circuits into layers and returns the noise model for each unique layer. `NoiseLearnerV3`, on the other hand, gives you control over how to stratify your circuits, and the program simply takes a list of boxed circuit instructions (for example, unique layers) as the inputs. \n"
msgstr "Podobně jako stávající [`NoiseLearner`](/guides/noise-learning) vrací tento pomocný program Qiskit Runtime řídký [Pauli-Lindblad šumový model](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866), který se používá v mnoha metodách potlačování chyb, včetně [PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec), [PEA](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) a [PNA](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna/tree/main). V původním `NoiseLearner` předáváš seznam Circuit a program rozvrství Circuit do vrstev a vrátí šumový model pro každou jedinečnou vrstvu. `NoiseLearnerV3` ti naproti tomu dává kontrolu nad tím, jak své Circuit rozvrstvit, a program jednoduše přijímá seznam blokovaných instrukcí Circuit (například jedinečné vrstvy) jako vstupy.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`NoiseLearnerV3` also supports measurement noise learning. For each instruction set in the input list, it runs the Pauli-Lindblad learning protocol if the set contains one- and two-qubit gates, and the [TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex) protocol if the set contains measurements.\n"
msgstr "`NoiseLearnerV3` také podporuje učení měřicího šumu. Pro každou sadu instrukcí ve vstupním seznamu spustí Pauli-Lindblad protokol učení, pokud sada obsahuje jednoQubitové a dvouQubitové Gate, a protokol [TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex), pokud sada obsahuje měření.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`NoiseLearnerV3` was released with [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes#0470-2026-05-12). To learn more, see the [Noise learning helper](/guides/noise-learning#noiselearnerv3) guide, and refer to its [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3) documentation.\n"
msgstr "`NoiseLearnerV3` byl vydán s [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes#0470-2026-05-12). Chceš-li se dozvědět více, podívej se na průvodce [Pomocníkem pro učení šumu](/guides/noise-learning#noiselearnerv3) a přečti si dokumentaci jeho [reference API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3).\n"

